	(text "Controls and LEDs. Four B10K pots on the Alchemist grid: Mix, Sustain, Strings (row +38) and Jawari (0, +13), across +3V3, wipers to ADC1 PA0, PA1, PA2, PA4 through 1k / 100n.\nThree Taiway 100-DP6 ON-ON-ON toggles, as The Alchemist: Tuning (-20, +13), Brightness (+20, +13), Retune (0, -5). Commons (2, 5) to GND, pins 3 and 4 to two MCU inputs with internal pull-ups: up = A low B high, centre = both low, down = A high B low.\nTwelve 0603 note LEDs, C to B, on PD0-PD11 (one port write), 1k each, behind 3 mm light pipes at face Y -18."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 15.24 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(face "Oswald")
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "8f911fd3-f15e-4cf6-98f1-259309923b6f")
	)
)
